## 8. Window estimate
The worker runs on the target from D7 to the end of D9 (run 1 harness: D7 2.3 s + D8 33.6 s + D9 10.1 s = about 46 s; the pg-boss cron of the 07:15 slot was caught up after the D9 restart). approval.escalation_scan fires every 15 minutes, so a run fails when that ~46-60 s window contains a quarter hour: about 5-7 % of runs by wall-clock time alone, plus the daily starters between 00:05 and 00:45 Asia/Riyadh (21:05-21:45 UTC).

